  "limits": [
    "Module 17 receives the CPP second-pass planes as a separate blend input. With job+0x7f clear, its blend destination descriptor aliases the ordinary scaler source. With job+0x7f equal to one, it instead aliases job+0x2354.",
    "The receiver's gate is replayed separately from the blend builder. The builder probes enter after feature and allocation checks and inject the blend mode. The zero mode issues two chroma requests. The tested modes 2 and 4 also issue a luma request.",
    "The scaler payload binds job+0x2354 as an auxiliary source and initializes its enable byte to zero. The verifier sets the byte to one only in a counterfactual probe. The auxiliary scaler destination job+0x238c is distinct from the tested JPEG input.",
    "The probes execute A32 address selection, dispatch and request assembly on aligned synthetic planes. Service calls and scaler launches are intercepted. The recipe rows establish relative order. Intervening stages and the resulting pixel contents, physical camera mode eligibility and JPEG bytes are untested."
  ]
